<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10687" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίφων-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sounding in answer, concordant,</i> as in the  octave, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύτητα βαρύτητι σύμφωνον καὶ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					812d
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμονίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.485
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>responsive to,</i> c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεναγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					800
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>discordant, contradictory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.361a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				16.1
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν γενησομένων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.412b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίφωνον, τό,</span>
			<i>concord in the octave,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. σύμφωνόν ἐστι διὰ πασῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					918b30
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				921a8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
